### fix_closure

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl fix_closure forall t. (depth : u8 * u8) (x : t) =\n    backend_switch {\n        Rust = fun () =>\n            inl is_unit : bool =\n                real\n                    typecase t with\n                    | () => true\n                    | _ => false\n            if is_unit\n            then (!\\($'\"true; () }); //\"') : bool) |> ignore\n            else ($'true; (!x) }); //' : bool) |> ignore\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl fix_closure forall t. (depth : u8 * u8) (x : t) =
      backend_switch {
          Rust = fun () =>
              inl is_unit : bool =
                  real
                      typecase t with
                      | () => true
                      | _ => false
              if is_unit
              then (!\($'"true; () }); //"') : bool) |> ignore
              else ($'true; (!x) }); //' : bool) |> ignore
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### loop

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl loop (depth : i32) (fn : () -> ()) : () =\n    (!\\($'\"true; loop { // rust.loop 1\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    fn ()\n\n    listm.init depth id\n    |> listm.iter fun n =>\n        (!\\($'\"true; } // rust.loop 2 / n: {!n}\"') : bool) |> ignore\n\n    (!\\($'\"true; } // rust.loop 3\"') : bool) |> ignore\n\n    listm.init depth id\n    |> listm.iter fun n =>\n        (!\\($'\"true; { // rust.loop 4 / n: {!n}\"') : bool) |> ignore","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
