### new_partial_eq_wrapper

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl new_partial_eq_wrapper forall t.\n    (eq_fn : ref (partial_eq_wrapper t) -> ref (partial_eq_wrapper t) -> bool)\n    (x : t)\n    : partial_eq_wrapper t\n    =\n    global \"#[derive(Debug, Clone)]\\npub struct PartialEqWrapper<T>(pub T);\\nimpl<T: ?Sized> PartialEq for PartialEqWrapper<std::sync::Arc<T>> {\\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool { std::sync::Arc::ptr_eq(&self.0, &other.0) }\\n}\"\n    $'PartialEqWrapper(!x.clone())' : partial_eq_wrapper t","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl new_partial_eq_wrapper forall t.
      (eq_fn : ref (partial_eq_wrapper t) -> ref (partial_eq_wrapper t) -> bool)
      (x : t)
      : partial_eq_wrapper t
      =
      global "#[derive(Debug, Clone)]\npub struct PartialEqWrapper<T>(pub T);\nimpl<T: ?Sized> PartialEq for PartialEqWrapper<std::sync::Arc<T>> {\n    fn eq(&self, other: &Self) -> bool { std::sync::Arc::ptr_eq(&self.0, &other.0) }\n}"
      $'PartialEqWrapper(!x.clone())' : partial_eq_wrapper t
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

